    "snowbird": {
      "status": "ok",
      "resort": "Snowbird",
      "adapter": "powdr",
      "updatedAt": "2026-04-18 05:37:00",
      "note": "Howdy and good morning! This is Kolton with your snow report for Saturday, April 18. Tax day snow came and went (just as I had predicted) and now we are back to sunny skies with a high of 46 degrees. Winds will be nice and light at 6 mph out of the South. Expect a mix of groomed runs and some powder pockets throughout the resort. The best soft snow will be located up high where yesterday’s sunshine will have had the smallest impact on snow temps. When you need a break, make sure to join in on my favorite Plazapalooza weekend of the year, Electronic Weekend . Today you’ve got DJ Force Gale and Fleetmac Wood, literally on deck. Chickadee is closed for a 50 year glow up, so if your parking at Superior lot, please make your way towards the bypass road for ski-in/ski-out access. ALL uphill travel is closed. Join us for more Surf Season and we’ll see you at The Bird. #GMTB",
      "metrics": {
        "snow24h": 0,
